#
# Allowed upward dependencies (from<TAB>to<TAB>reason). Shrink-only: delete the
# line in the commit that removes the edge. A new upward dependency is a design
# defect; fix the layering instead of adding a line here.
brain-januspro	brain-runtime	the image-generation resident drives the event runtime directly; move the controller seam down or invert the dependency
brain-npu	brain-eval	the NPU export reuses eval's detection scoring; move that scoring into a layer 3 crate
brain-npu	brain-perf	the NPU export only needs stats::Dist, which perf re-uses; depend on brain-stats directly
